<title>USA: Integrated Health sets $450 mln 10-yr notes.</title>
<headline>Integrated Health sets $450 mln 10-yr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from</p>
<p>Integrated Health Services Inc was priced on Thursday in the</p>
<p>144A private placement market via lead manager Smith Barney</p>
<p>Inc, dealers said.</p>
<p>BORROWER INTEGRATED HEALTH SERVICES INC</p>
<p>AMT $450 MLN	 COUPON 9.50	 MATURITY  09/15/07</p>
